                                        │ ‼ requires manual intervention                            
                                        │                                                           
                                        │  With  20251021-1 , the firmware files have been          
                                        │  split into several packages. Due to the file moves,      
                                        │  the upgrade requires manual intervention:                
                                        │                                                           
                                        │    pacman -Rdd linux-firmware                             
                                        │    pacman -Syu linux-firmware                             
                                        │                                                           
                                        │  Upgrading without doing this first will fail with        
                                        │  file conflicts in  /usr/lib/firmware .                   
